[I] PPD support for cups-filters

[T] libppd is the OpenPrinting library for handling PPD (PostScript Printer
[T] Description) files, split off from cups-filters 2.x. It contains the PPD
[T] related functions that were deprecated and removed from CUPS, so that
[T] classic PPD based printer drivers keep working.

[U] https://github.com/OpenPrinting/libppd

[A] OpenPrinting
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

